    {
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "@sftse \nHi, I still get the same OOM issue on the latest tokenizer version (Version: 0.21.1). When training on a ~20GB corpus, the program consumes over 1TB memory at the `Count pairs` step and got killed by the system.\nHere is my training code:\n```\ntokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(base_tokenizer_name, token=args.token, trust_remote_code=True)\nnew_tokenizer = tokenizer.train_new_from_iterator(\n    final_text_iterator,\n    vocab_size=args.vocab_size,\n    new_special_tokens=ADDITIONAL_SPECIAL_TOKENS\n    )\n```",
      "created_at": "2025-04-02T02:45:02Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/huggingface/tokenizers/issues/1681#issuecomment-2771204799",
